at identity delegation is still in developer preview\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"e500ebc46374e55a7ca84b51f49dc81ac8504326","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uniformdev/examples/git/trees/e500ebc46374e55a7ca84b51f49dc81ac8504326"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uniformdev/examples/git/commits/41d6378d39908a9729e295bf9f96c3a98e36d5d4","verification":{"payload":"tree e500ebc46374e55a7ca84b51f49dc81ac8504326\nparent aa5ba90262cf0f97f3f4ce9b4d935afd99da9a31\nauthor Artem <artemm@uniform.dev> 1784883619 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784883619 +0200\n\nfeat: adding nextjs and vanilla mesh identity delegation examples (#326)\n\n* feat: adding nextjs and vanilla mesh identity delegation examples\n\n* chore(mesh-bulk-update): implemented latest fixes to cookie options, security, revalidation, etc\n\n* chore(mesh): add constrains on publishing script to bulk publish\n\n* chore: improve composition search, add deployed manifest\n\n* chore(mesh): updated examples according to the latest identity delegation progress\n\n* chore(mesh): sync bulk-publish example with platform delegation reference\n\nAlign CSRF, session handling, security headers, and admin project tools with platform experiment/delegation-token; bump Uniform packages to 20.50.2-alpha.117.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* deps(mesh): bumped to latest delegation packages with breaking changes\n\n* feat(delegation): switched to lighter identity delegation example\n\n* chore: deleted old delegation examples, updated ai rule and readme files for mesh section\n\n* chore: mention that identity delegation is still in developer preview\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYymjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7LAQAHsqGF0fd/TxMVDxaZKVR/T4\ne9rCahd0H2ieRmJ8q0wklq+muOyPtMXfLMsE6pAGbY2vijymrMKv5LIrI9Ai4dYy\nlsh9JvalQp+0TFouP6BNz9+kzdXmBCgxcBkSig