/users/mkolar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkolar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynput/ayon-frontend/commits/163ede12e99d4f82511e56b0ec142be80d331c80/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T23:23:20Z","email":"milan@ynput.io","name":"Milan Kolar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T23:23:20Z","email":"milan@ynput.io","name":"Milan Kolar"},"message":"fix: review page no longer crashes while the review cards modules load\n\nProjectListsDetailsPanels loaded its own copy of the review cards modules and\ncalled the review addon''s useReviewSessionCards as soon as that module had\narrived. The page renders the addon''s ReviewCardsProvider from a separate load,\nso when the hook arrived first it ran under the fallback provider and threw\n\"useReviewSessionCardsContext must be used within a ReviewSessionCardsProvider\",\nwhich replaced the whole app with the error screen.\n\nThe details panels now get the hook from the page''s modules, and the hook is\nonly the addon''s one once the addon''s provider has loaded.","tree":{"sha":"e86585fde4f50a5eaf76176405b849d3a982788c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynput/ayon-frontend/git/trees/e86585fde4f50a5eaf76176405b849d3a982788c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynput/ayon-frontend/git/commits/163ede12e99d4f82511e56b0ec142be80d331c80","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3333008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkolar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkolar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkolar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkolar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mkolar","id":3333008,"login":"mkolar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzMwMDg=","organizations_url":"