/ayon-frontend/commits/6ce1774a7859723da1cff8e65499dc93654157a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T23:18:53Z","email":"milan@ynput.io","name":"Milan Kolar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T23:18:53Z","email":"milan@ynput.io","name":"Milan Kolar"},"message":"fix: task progress and workfiles no longer query project \"null\"\n\nBoth pages read the project name from redux, which ProjectPage only sets in an\neffect once the project addons have loaded. When the remote modules were ready\nbefore the addons, the page rendered in the same commit and its first queries\nran with null: GET /api/projects/null, /anatomy, /siteRoots and\nGetKanbanProjectUsers with projects [null].\n\nTake the project name from the project context (the route) instead.","tree":{"sha":"f6997c55edbb109451b02a4a68075526702ae864","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynput/ayon-frontend/git/trees/f6997c55edbb109451b02a4a68075526702ae864"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynput/ayon-frontend/git/commits/6ce1774a7859723da1cff8e65499dc93654157a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3333008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkolar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkolar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkolar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkolar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mkolar","id":3333008,"login":"mkolar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzMwMDg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkolar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkolar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkolar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkolar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkolar/subscriptions","typ